# Signing material — never commit. This repo is public; a leaked distribution
# certificate or App Store Connect key lets anyone sign and upload builds as us.
# These belong in GitHub Secrets (see .github/workflows/testflight.yml).
*.p12
*.p8
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
